=== REASONING ===
- Widget maps CoachRecommendation[] → TipItem[] for WidgetTipCards shared component
- Compact mode (1×2): efficiency score number + potential savings badge
- Standard mode (2×4): score header + top 3 tips via WidgetTipCards (maxTips=3)
- Savings % calculated from (currentEff - bestEff) / currentEff
- All strings use useTranslation('dashboard')
- Null-safe: data?.overall_score ?? 0, data?.recommendations ?? [], rec.tip ?? '—'
- No unit conversion needed — score is dimensionless, efficiency ratio is internal

